                <pb facs="0222" n="110" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg110"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4737/35.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Taft to the
                            President of Brazil.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-01-17"><hi rendition="#italic">January 17,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>For my countrymen and in my own name I offer heartfelt condolence upon the death
                    of Ambassador Nabuco.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wm. H. Taft.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
